{"version":1,"id":"toby-keith-courtesy-of-the-red-white-and-blue","title":"Courtesy Of The Red White And Blue","artist":"Toby Keith","key":"D","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/toby-keith/courtesy-of-the-red-white-and-blue/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Toby Keith","chords":[{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#m","canonical":"F#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,9,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"GDA","canonical":null,"keyboardPitchClasses":[],"interpretation":"No verified cello diagram for this symbol. Source chord retained."},{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm-","canonical":null,"keyboardPitchClasses":[],"interpretation":"No verified cello diagram for this symbol. Source chord retained."},{"symbol":"F#m-","canonical":null,"keyboardPitchClasses":[],"interpretation":"No verified cello diagram for this symbol. Source chord retained."},{"symbol":"Gm","canonical":"Gm","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,10,2],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"American girls and American guys we’ll always stand up and salute we’ll always recognize","columns":88,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":19,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm","column":46,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F#m","column":78,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"When we see Old Glory flying there’s a lot of men dead so we can sleep in peace at night when we","columns":96,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":36,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A","column":58,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":" lay down our heads","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"(From here until the end of the chorus use barre chords)","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"My daddy served in the army and he lost his right eye but he flew a flag out in our yard","columns":88,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm","column":61,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Until the day that he died he wanted my mother, my brother, my sister and me to grow up and live","columns":96,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":40,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":60,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A","column":80,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":" happy in the land of the free","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Now this nation that I love has fallen under attack a mighty sucker punch came flying in","columns":88,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":39,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm","column":61,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"From somewhere in the back soon as we could see clearly through our big black eye man we","columns":88,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":68,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Man, lit up your world like the Fourth of July","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"section","text":"Chorus","columns":6,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Uncle Sam put your name at the top of his list and the Statue of Liberty started shaking","columns":88,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":31,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":55,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm","column":81,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Her fist and the eagle will fly and it’s gonna be hell when you hear mother freedom start","columns":89,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":41,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":60,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Ringing her bell and it’ll feel like the whole wide world is raining down on you brought","columns":88,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":27,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A","column":52,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm","column":77,"beat":6},{"symbol":"G","column":80,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"To you courtesy of the red white and blue","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":15,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Bridge: D A Bm F# G D A (use regular chords)","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Justice will be served and the battle will rage this big dog will fight when you rattle","columns":87,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":31,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm","column":53,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F#m","column":81,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"                   G                              D     (barre chord here)  a","columns":77,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"His cage you’ll be sorry that you messed with the U S of A 'Cuz we’ll put a boot in your","columns":88,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Ass it’s the American way","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Chorus (back to barre chords through the end)","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"   Of the red white and blue","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"GDA","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"   Of my red white and blue","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"GDA","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Chords","columns":6,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Barre CHORDS","columns":65,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":17,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm-","column":27,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F#m-","column":40,"beat":6},{"symbol":"Gm","column":56,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"instrumental","text":"|- 057700    577000     0244000          244000           355000","columns":66,"beats":14,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Bm-","column":22,"beat":4},{"symbol":"F#m-","column":38,"beat":6},{"symbol":"Gm","column":57,"beat":8}]}]}